  "2026-08-17T07:36:46.082Z","harness:codex","Evidence 2026-08-17: added a typed exporter output contract with stdout|file channels, suppress|render receipt policy, media type inventory, derived help, and host-output suppression. Real installed-extension dispatch proves JSON, CSV, opaque bytes, stderr summaries, file receipts, and global --json without artifact duplication. Linked tests passed 16/16; the full repository suite passed 7,468/7,468 at exact 100/100/100/100. Packed artifact, type, lint, contract, security, audit, package-boundary, and docstring gates passed."
