learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-17T07:36:47.382Z","harness:codex","Artifact ownership must be declared before handler dispatch. A stdout producer needs host rendering suppressed by default, while file producers may return bounded receipts; human summaries belong on stderr. Normalizing this in registration metadata makes clean output a compositional invariant rather than extension-specific convention."
